{"4136560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "11 Trials of Raz", "steam_appid": 4136560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/bd73604668b1a29a94a0903f6d796226.avif?t=1787421079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras_big/bd73604668b1a29a94a0903f6d796226.webp?t=1787421079 width=1560 height=548 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/df15e47ac2d6e12ce7cd516f46f13de2.poster.avif?t=1787421079\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/df15e47ac2d6e12ce7cd516f46f13de2.webm?t=1787421079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/df15e47ac2d6e12ce7cd516f46f13de2.mp4?t=1787421079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the truth hidden inside an endless loop.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>11 Trials of Raz</i></strong> is a first-person anomaly-detection game where each step forward brings you closer to escape… or deeper into the loop. Memorize the room, trust your instincts, and survive the eleven trials before the bar swallows you whole.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/940a19652001f7f76050fce5cb4ec00f.avif?t=1787421079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras_big/940a19652001f7f76050fce5cb4ec00f.webp?t=1787421079 width=1560 height=581 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside a strangely familiar bar - quiet, empty, frozen in time.  <br>Your <strong>trial number marks the wall</strong>. This is where every loop begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how far you go, <strong>you always return here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/449fb32562ffd74757fb897e74e931a5.avif?t=1787421079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras_big/449fb32562ffd74757fb897e74e931a5.webp?t=1787421079 width=1560 height=581 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look closely. Memorize every detail.  <br>At first glance, nothing changes - but the loop is never truly the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your memory is your most important tool. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/2287a6fa6ded1c893083a995ba06e49b.avif?t=1787421079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras_big/2287a6fa6ded1c893083a995ba06e49b.webp?t=1787421079 width=1560 height=581 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If the room looks unchanged → move forward</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you spot something wrong → go back</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess correctly <strong>11 times</strong> to break the loop. <br>Fail… and the cycle continues.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/23fe5038f4c8137e9a960021ed4d48d7.avif?t=1787421079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras_big/23fe5038f4c8137e9a960021ed4d48d7.webp?t=1787421079 width=1560 height=581 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some changes are real. <br>Others are tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objects vanish. Lights distort. Furniture shifts. <br>And sometimes… <strong>nothing is actually wrong.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raz is always watching - and every mistake amuses him. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/789e96927e274105fa98f8b4fde3b812.avif?t=1787421079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras_big/789e96927e274105fa98f8b4fde3b812.webp?t=1787421079 width=1560 height=581 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each correct decision brings you closer to freedom. <br>Each mistake pushes you deeper into Raz’s game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no hints - only your awareness.</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/f3e75df1a4d87cd909b10cb8b93f4fdd.avif?t=1787421079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras_big/f3e75df1a4d87cd909b10cb8b93f4fdd.webp?t=1787421079 width=1560 height=581 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your journey:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill</strong> - Clear, easy-to-spot anomalies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal</strong> - Subtle changes mixed with deceptive pseudo-anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror</strong> - Distorted reality, psychological tricks, jump scares, and highly discreet anomalies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The room stays the same. <br>Your perception does not.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/c4b8fb9522dbc81a5bc7d316819743a4.avif?t=1787421079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras_big/c4b8fb9522dbc81a5bc7d316819743a4.webp?t=1787421079 width=1560 height=581 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Horror mode</strong>, the bar stops playing fair. <br>Expect dangerous anomalies, sudden jump scares, and aggressive distortions of reality. <br>Some mistakes don’t just reset the loop - they <strong>punish it</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/0f15bef9bb2f3e9e74a6a5e255c14b32.avif?t=1787421079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras_big/0f15bef9bb2f3e9e74a6a5e255c14b32.webp?t=1787421079 width=1560 height=581 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, nothing helps you except what you remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bar hides its secrets in the smallest details. <br>Some changes whisper. Others watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The loop tests more than your vision - it tests how deeply you pay attention.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you escape Raz’s trials or fade quietly into the loop?</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/bd73604668b1a29a94a0903f6d796226.avif?t=1787421079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras_big/bd73604668b1a29a94a0903f6d796226.webp?t=1787421079 width=1560 height=548 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136560/extras/df15e47ac2d6e